WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:04.570
I hope that time of Bible study
and journaling, I hope that it

2
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.410
was fruitful for you.

3
00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:11.050
I pray that it was filling for
you, that it was nutritious in

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.410
some way. And maybe it
was even surprising.

5
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:16.410
I love when God does that.

6
00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:20.090
I love when God will take some
of those ordinary moments and

7
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.010
you're just kind of
sitting with him.

8
00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.010
And maybe you're sitting on
something that you're like, man,

9
00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.450
something I've been
waiting on God for.

10
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.610
You're just like,
oh, here we go again.

11
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.810
And then all of a sudden,
he just hits you with a new

12
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.370
perspective or a new idea.

13
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:38.010
Or he leads someone into your
life that shows it to you

14
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.930
in a different way.

15
00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.010
Maybe he opens a
door or closes it.

16
00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.670
He does something.

17
00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.830
And he does it in
a supernatural way.

18
00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.270
And you know why he does that?

19
00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.960
To strengthen your faith.

20
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.070
Because you need stronger faith.

21
00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.590
So do I. We all
need stronger faith.

22
00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:02.150
And this training focus that
we're in this month on hope

23
00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.790
is really an incredible opportunity
for us to just do that, to

24
00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.950
strengthen our faith.

25
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:09.830
Let me pray for you.

26
00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.790
Heavenly Father, thank
you for today, Lord.

27
00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.110
Thank you, God. Thank you for
your hope and the opportunity that

28
00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:20.310
we have, Lord, to put
our hope in your word.

29
00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:24.920
God, thank you that your word
never returns void, Lord.

30
00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:27.540
It never fails.

31
00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:30.440
God, that it strengthens us.

32
00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:33.560
It is like spiritual protein.

33
00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:38.040
It is the building block that
we need for everything else that

34
00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:41.160
we're going to do
in our lives, Lord.

35
00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:45.880
So, as we fuel ourselves on
the word, God, thank you for

36
00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:47.560
strengthening our faith.

37
00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:50.290
In Jesus' name, amen.

